# QPACK (RFC 9204) field decompression.
#
# Built in only, like hpack/ beside it: the decoder is reached by a direct
# call from whatever holds the connection state, so there is nothing for the
# module dispatcher to register and no DYN variant.
#
# static.h is generated from the RFC by rfc9204.py in this directory and is
# checked in. The Huffman automaton is hpack's (../hpack/huffman.h): RFC 9204
# §4.1.2 adopts RFC 7541 Appendix B unchanged, so there is one generator and
# one table to trust.
obj-$(CONFIG_CRYPTO_TRANSFORM_QPACK) += qpack.o
